    "notes": "When a player breaks msm_examples:star_block, one thing happens, picked at random by weight: it drops prizes rolled from msm_examples:star_block/prizes (weight 3), or brings a creeper (weight 1), or places the building msm_examples:star_block/surprise_hut (weight 6), or gives higher jumps for 30 seconds (weight 3). On export the book becomes the block's break event and a generated script, so it needs the Fabric mod jar export.",
